text: ["({T}: Add {B} or {R}.)\nAs Blood Crypt enters the battlefield, you may pay 2 life. If you don't, it enters the battlefield tapped.", '({T}: Add {B}.)', "({T}: Add {G} or {U}.)\nAs Breeding Pool enters the battlefield, you may pay 2 life. If you don't, it enters the battlefield tapped.", '({T}: Add {G}.)', "({T}: Add {R} or {G}.)\nAs Stomping Ground enters the battlefield, you may pay 2 life. If you don't, it enters the battlefield tapped.", '({T}: Add {R}.)', '({T}: Add {U}.)', "({T}: Add {W} or {B}.)\nAs Godless Shrine enters the battlefield, you may pay 2 life. If you don't, it enters the battlefield tapped.", "({T}: Add {W} or {U}.)\nAs Hallowed Fountain enters the battlefield, you may pay 2 life. If you don't, it enters the battlefield tapped.", '({T}: Add {W}.)', "Activated abilities of creatures you control cost {2} less to activate. This effect can't reduce the mana in that cost to less than one mana.\n{T}: The next time target creature adapts this turn, it adapts as though it had no +1/+1 counters on it.", 'Afterlife 2 (When this creature dies, create two 1/1 white and black Spirit creature tokens with flying.)', 'All creatures get -2/-2 until end of turn. Exile all creature cards in all graveyards that were put there from the battlefield this turn. If a creature would die this turn, exile it instead.', 'As an additional cost to cast this spell, pay 5 life or sacrifice a creature or enchantment.\nDestroy target creature.', 'As an additional cost to cast this spell, sacrifice two creatures.\nDraw three cards.', "As long as you control a Dovin planeswalker, Dovin's Automaton gets +2/+2 and has vigilance. (Attacking doesn't cause it to tap.)", 'At the beginning of your end step, untap all lands you control.', 'At the beginning of your upkeep, Ill-Gotten Inheritance deals 1 damage to each opponent and you gain 1 life.\n{5}{B}, Sacrifice Ill-Gotten Inheritance: It deals 4 damage to target opponent and you gain 4 life.', 'At the beginning of your upkeep, exile the top card of your library.\nDuring your turn, if an opponent lost life this turn, you may play lands and cast spells from among cards exiled with Theater of Horrors.\n{3}{R}: Theater of Horrors deals 1 damage to target opponent or planeswalker.', "At the beginning of your upkeep, reveal cards from the top of your library until you reveal a creature card. Until your next turn, Amplifire's base power becomes twice that card's power and its base toughness becomes twice that card's toughness. Put the revealed cards on the bottom of your library in a random order.", 'At the beginning of your upkeep, scry 1.\n{5}{U}: Exchange control of Eyes Everywhere and target nonland permanent. Activate only as a sorcery.', 'Azorius Guildgate enters the battlefield tapped.\n{T}: Add {W} or {U}.', "Captive Audience enters the battlefield under the control of an opponent of your choice.\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, choose one that hasn't been chosen —\n• Your life total becomes 4.\n• Discard your hand.\n• Each opponent creates five 2/2 black Zombie creature tokens.", "Carnival deals 1 damage to target creature or planeswalker and 1 damage to that permanent's controller.", "Choose one or both —\n• Put target creature on top of its owner's library.\n• Return target creature to its owner's hand.", "Choose one or both —\n• Target creature gets +1/+1 until end of turn.\n• Return target creature to its owner's hand.", 'Choose one —\n• Destroy target artifact.\n• Destroy target creature with defender.', 'Collision deals 6 damage to target creature with flying.', "Counter target activated or triggered ability. (Mana abilities can't be targeted.)", 'Counter target creature spell. Put a +1/+1 counter on up to one target creature you control.', 'Counter target spell unless its controller pays {2}.', 'Counter target spell. Its controller mills three cards.', 'Counter target spell. You gain 3 life.', 'Create a number of 1/1 red Goblin creature tokens equal to two plus the number of cards named Goblin Gathering in your graveyard.', "Creature spells you control can't be countered.\nNontoken creatures you control have riot. (They enter the battlefield with your choice of a +1/+1 counter or haste.)", 'Creatures you control gain indestructible until end of turn.\nAddendum — If you cast this spell during your main phase, put a +1/+1 counter on each of those creatures and they gain vigilance until end of turn.', 'Creatures you control get +0/+5 and gain reach until end of turn.', "Creatures you control get +1/+1.\nCreatures your opponents control get -1/-1.\n{2}{W}{B}: Exile target card from an opponent's graveyard. If it was a creature card, you create a 1/1 white and black Spirit creature token with flying.", 'Creatures you control get +1/+3 until end of turn. Untap them.', 'Creatures you control get +2/+0 until end of turn.', 'Deathtouch', 'Deathtouch\nAfterlife 1 (When this creature dies, create a 1/1 white and black Spirit creature token with flying.)', 'Defender\nWhen Wall of Lost Thoughts enters the battlefield, target player mills four cards.', 'Defender\n{1}, Sacrifice Resolute Watchdog: Target creature you control gains indestructible until end of turn. (Damage and effects that say "destroy" don\'t destroy it.)', "Defender\n{6}{G/U}{G/U}: Adapt 3. (If this creature has no +1/+1 counters on it, put three +1/+1 counters on it.)\nAs long as Scuttlegator has a +1/+1 counter on it, it can attack as though it didn't have defender.", 'Defender\n{T}, Tap an untapped creature you control: Add one mana of any color.', "Defender\n{T}: Put target card from a graveyard on the bottom of its owner's library.", 'Defender\n{T}: Spear Spewer deals 1 damage to each player.', 'Destroy all artifacts and enchantments. For each permanent destroyed this way, its controller creates a 3/3 green Centaur creature token.', 'Destroy all creatures. You gain life equal to the number of creatures you controlled that were destroyed this way.', 'Destroy target artifact or enchantment. Scry 1.', 'Destroy target artifact, creature, or planeswalker.', 'Destroy target creature or enchantment.', "Destroy target creature with flying. Sagittars' Volley deals 1 damage to each creature with flying your opponents control.", "Destroy target creature. Consign to the Pit deals 2 damage to that creature's controller.", 'Destroy target creature. Scry 1.', 'Destroy target land. Scry 2.', 'Distribute three +1/+1 counters among one, two, or three target creatures, then double the number of +1/+1 counters on each of those creatures.', 'Draw a card. You may put a land card from your hand onto the battlefield.', 'Draw four cards, then discard two cards.', 'Draw three cards.\nAddendum — If you cast this spell during your main phase, instead scry 3, then draw three cards.', 'Draw two cards.\nAddendum — If you cast this spell during your main phase, you gain 2 life.', "During your turn, spells your opponents cast cost {1} more to cast and abilities your opponents activate cost {1} more to activate unless they're mana abilities.\nAfterlife 1 (When this creature dies, create a 1/1 white and black Spirit creature token with flying.)", "Each creature you control assigns combat damage equal to its toughness rather than its power.\nCreatures you control can attack as though they didn't have defender.\n{2}{W}{U}: Untap target creature.", "Each opponent can't cast noncreature spells with mana value greater than the number of lands that player controls.\nWhenever an opponent casts a spell, if no mana was spent to cast it, counter that spell.", 'Each player discards all the cards in their hand, then creates that many 2/2 black Zombie creature tokens.', 'Each player shuffles their hand and graveyard into their library, then draws seven cards. Exile Emergency Powers.\nAddendum — If you cast this spell during your main phase, you may put a permanent card with mana value 7 or less from your hand onto the battlefield.', 'Electrodominance deals X damage to any target. You may cast a spell with mana value X or less from your hand without paying its mana cost.', 'Enchant creature\nEnchanted creature has defender and loses flying.', "Enraged Ceratok can't be blocked by creatures with power 2 or less.", 'Equipped creature gets +0/+3 and has "{2}, {T}: Target player mills three cards."\nEquip {3} ({3}: Attach to target creature you control. Equip only as a sorcery.)', 'Exile target card from a graveyard.\nDraw a card.', 'Exile target creature with power 3 or less.', 'Exile target creature with power 4 or greater.', "Exile target creature you control, then return that card to the battlefield under its owner's control. It gains first strike until end of turn.", 'Flames of the Raze-Boar deals 4 damage to target creature an opponent controls. Then Flames of the Raze-Boar deals 2 damage to each other creature that player controls if you control a creature with power 4 or greater.', "Flash\nEnchant creature\nEnchanted creature can't attack or block, and its activated abilities can't be activated.", "Flash\nEnchant creature\nEnchanted creature gets +1/+2 and has vigilance.\nAddendum — When Sentinel's Mark enters the battlefield, if you cast it during your main phase, enchanted creature gains lifelink until end of turn.", 'Flash\nEnchant creature\nEnchanted creature gets -4/-0.', 'Flash\nFlying\nWhen Angel of Grace enters the battlefield, until end of turn, damage that would reduce your life total to less than 1 reduces it to 1 instead.\n{4}{W}{W}, Exile Angel of Grace from your graveyard: Your life total becomes 10.', 'Flash\nFlying\nWhen Faerie Duelist enters the battlefield, target creature an opponent controls gets -2/-0 until end of turn.', 'Flash\nFlying\nWhen Spire Mangler enters the battlefield, target creature with flying you control gets +2/+0 until end of turn.', 'Flash\nWhen Frilled Mystic enters the battlefield, you may counter target spell.', 'Flying', 'Flying\nAfterlife 1 (When this creature dies, create a 1/1 white and black Spirit creature token with flying.)', 'Flying\nOther creatures you control with flying get +0/+1.', 'Flying\nOther creatures you control with flying get +1/+0.', 'Flying\nWhen Archway Angel enters the battlefield, you gain 2 life for each Gate you control.', 'Flying\nWhen Carrion Imp enters the battlefield, you may exile target creature card from a graveyard. If you do, you gain 2 life.', "Flying\nWhen Chillbringer enters the battlefield, tap target creature an opponent controls. It doesn't untap during its controller's next untap step.", 'Flying\nWhen Grasping Thrull enters the battlefield, it deals 2 damage to each opponent and you gain 2 life.', 'Flying\nWhen Senate Griffin enters the battlefield, scry 1.', 'Flying\n{1}{W}: Senate Courier gains vigilance until end of turn.', 'Flying\n{2}{G}{U}: Adapt 1. (If this creature has no +1/+1 counters on it, put a +1/+1 counter on it.)', 'Flying\n{7}{U}: Adapt 4. This ability costs {1} less to activate for each instant and sorcery card in your graveyard. (If this creature has no +1/+1 counters on it, put four +1/+1 counters on it.)', 'Flying\n{W}: Seraph of the Scales gains vigilance until end of turn.\n{B}: Seraph of the Scales gains deathtouch until end of turn.\nAfterlife 2 (When this creature dies, create two 1/1 white and black Spirit creature tokens with flying.)', 'Flying, first strike\nCreatures your opponents control get -1/-0.', "Flying, lifelink\nWhenever The Haunt of Hightower attacks, defending player discards a card.\nWhenever a card is put into an opponent's graveyard from anywhere, put a +1/+1 counter on The Haunt of Hightower.", "Flying, trample\nWhen Rakdos, the Showstopper enters the battlefield, flip a coin for each creature that isn't a Demon, Devil, or Imp. Destroy each creature whose coin comes up tails.", 'Flying, vigilance\nSpells your opponents cast that target Sphinx of New Prahv cost {2} more to cast.', 'Gain control of X target creatures and/or planeswalkers.', 'Gain control of target creature until end of turn. Untap that creature. It gains haste until end of turn. (It can attack and {T} this turn.)', 'Gatebreaker Ram gets +1/+1 for each Gate you control.\nAs long as you control two or more Gates, Gatebreaker Ram has vigilance and trample.', 'Gates Ablaze deals X damage to each creature, where X is the number of Gates you control.', 'Gateway Plaza enters the battlefield tapped.\nWhen Gateway Plaza enters the battlefield, sacrifice it unless you pay {1}.\n{T}: Add one mana of any color.', 'Gruul Guildgate enters the battlefield tapped.\n{T}: Add {R} or {G}.', 'Gutterbones enters the battlefield tapped.\n{1}{B}: Return Gutterbones from your graveyard to your hand. Activate only during your turn and only if an opponent lost life this turn.', 'Haste\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, you may sacrifice a creature. When you do, Fireblade Artist deals 2 damage to target opponent or planeswalker.', "Haste\n{R}: Tin Street Dodger can't be blocked this turn except by creatures with defender.", "Haste (This creature can attack and {T} as soon as it comes under your control.)\nAs long as you control a Domri planeswalker, Charging War Boar gets +1/+1 and has trample. (It can deal excess damage to the player or planeswalker it's attacking.)", "Hexproof (This creature can't be the target of spells or abilities your opponents control.)", 'If a creature dying causes a triggered ability of a permanent you control to trigger, that ability triggers an additional time.\nCreature tokens you control have vigilance and lifelink.', 'Knight of Sorrows can block an additional creature each combat.\nAfterlife 1 (When this creature dies, create a 1/1 white and black Spirit creature token with flying.)', 'Lifelink', 'Lifelink\n{2}{B}: Thirsting Shade gets +1/+1 until end of turn.', 'Look at the top five cards of your library. You may reveal a creature card from among them and put it into your hand. Put the rest on the bottom of your library in a random order.', 'Look at the top four cards of your library. Put one of them into your hand and the rest on the bottom of your library in a random order.', "Menace (This creature can't be blocked except by two or more creatures.)\n{3}{R}: Rakdos Trumpeter gets +2/+0 until end of turn.", 'Menace, deathtouch\nInstant and sorcery spells you control have deathtouch. (Any amount of damage they deal to a creature is enough to destroy it.)', 'Multicolored creatures you control get +1/+1.', 'Orzhov Guildgate enters the battlefield tapped.\n{T}: Add {W} or {B}.', 'Other creatures you control get +1/+0.\nWhenever a nontoken creature you control dies, Judith, the Scourge Diva deals 1 damage to any target.', 'Prevent all combat damage that would be dealt this turn.', 'Put a +1/+1 counter on target creature you control. Untap that creature.', "Put target attacking or blocking creature on top of its owner's library.", "Put target creature card from an opponent's graveyard onto the battlefield under your control. It gets +2/+0 and gains haste until end of turn. Sacrifice it at the beginning of the next end step.", "Put up to one target tapped creature on top of its owner's library. You may search your library and/or graveyard for a card named Dovin, Architect of Law, reveal it, and put it into your hand. If you search your library this way, shuffle.", 'Ragefire deals 3 damage to target creature.', 'Rakdos Guildgate enters the battlefield tapped.\n{T}: Add {B} or {R}.', 'Reach', 'Reach (This creature can block creatures with flying.)', 'Return target creature card with mana value 3 or less from your graveyard to the battlefield.', "Return target creature to its owner's hand.\nAddendum — If you cast this spell during your main phase, draw a card.", 'Return up to two target permanent cards from your graveyard to your hand.', 'Riot (This creature enters the battlefield with your choice of a +1/+1 counter or haste.)', 'Riot (This creature enters the battlefield with your choice of a +1/+1 counter or haste.)\nFlying\n{3}{R}: Skarrgan 